<p>感谢以下各位为本文提出的意见<br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/2big" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6150188); return false;"><img class="small" src="https://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6150188&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608522248" alt="2BIG" style="background-image:url(https://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6150188)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/2big" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6150188); return false;">2BIG</a></span><br />
